# Vulnerabilities the image scan in .github/workflows/docker-publish.yml does
# not block a release on. The scan fails on a CRITICAL vulnerability that has a
# fixed version, unless its ID is listed here.
#
# One ID per line (CVE-..., GHSA-...). Above each, say why the worker cannot
# reach the vulnerable code, and the date the entry was added. A finding the
# worker can reach is fixed instead: a package upgrade in the Dockerfile, or a
# newer base digest.
